# API conventions

- Prefix all HTTP routes with `/v1`. Serve OpenAPI at `/v1/docs`.
- Use `ValidationPipe({ whitelist: true, transform: true })`.
- Success: `{ data }` or `{ data, meta }`. Errors: `{ error: { code, message, details } }`.
- Auth: `Authorization: Bearer`. Locale: `Accept-Language: en | fr` (default `en`).
- Public GETs for catalog/CMS. `POST /v1/quotes` may be anonymous. Staff routes require `ops_agent` or `admin`.
- Rate-limit `/v1/auth/*` more strictly than public reads.
- Follow `docs/api/conventions.md` for quote payload and status codes (`401`, `403`, `404`, `409`, `429`, `502`).

```typescript
// ❌ BAD
return { ok: true, user };

// ✅ GOOD
return { data: { user, accessToken, refreshToken } };
```
